  <item>
    <title>05.从180斤重塑肉身：拯救自己千千万万次（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6803a46d1f1db84a564ebbb9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6803a46d1f1db84a564ebbb9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Apr 2025 13:38:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftiskz1xACKGEMrMdHpD2VuVKlsY.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>↑ 这就是广东省省碗（图源网络）</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>/Summary</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>当但丁笔下的暴食地狱在现代显形——从被奶茶腌透舌苔的酗糖成瘾期，到把牛仔裤裆部磨出破洞的至暗时刻；从逃避体检报告的自欺欺人，到自厌与异样目光的围剿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当维吉尔没有到来，金花选择把自己变成自己的引路人——从180斤到130斤，金花用一年零2个月，完成了一场肉体的浩大迁徙，50斤的剥离不仅是脂肪的消融，更是挣脱自我否定、重建生活秩序、直面他人审视的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客不是减肥指南，而是一份金花写给自己的自我救赎日记：即使在无法熄灭食欲与现代焦虑的永夜里，也能在自己的骨骼里栽种千万个黎明。</span></p><span></span><p><span>永远拯救自己，哪怕千千万万次。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Show Note</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 轻舟已过万重山：180斤背后的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="608">10:08</a> 压力下的情绪性进食：外卖成堆的夜晚与酗糖麻木的味蕾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 童年到大体重时期的身材焦虑：被“白幼瘦”审美定义的成长期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 超重者的「隐形困境」：爱好的丧失、异样的目光与不敢拍照的自厌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 文化反思：从《神曲》到《千与千寻》，谈谈社会审美规训下的枷锁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 信任身体的信号：为什么吃饱了却停不下筷子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2091">34:51</a> 体检报告背后的心理博弈：年轻身体的「自欺欺人」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2261">37:41</a> 如何帮助超重朋友？观察信号，表达接纳，做好自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2687">44:47</a> 超重者的「难言之隐」：从肉褶闷疹到磨破的牛仔裤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2967">49:27</a> 打破身体羞耻：我们需要的不是「潜力股」标签，而是去评判化的目光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 轻装上阵：寻找自己「天时、地利、人和」的最佳组合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4103">1:08:23</a> 最重要的是持续地去做：朋友与专业人士的陪伴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4346">1:12:26</a> 掌握营养学知识：碳蛋脂比例真的很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4801">1:20:01</a> 996 打工人怎么减肥：找到适合自己的运动方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5300">1:28:20</a> 身体不会辜负你：减肥是成年人成本最低的逆袭</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Message</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>林恩提及的「看理想APP节目」：《自由的黎明：文艺复兴经典选读》——徐贲</span></p><span></span><p><span>金花提及的「健身博主」：猛哥聊减脂（小红书）、好人松松（B站）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播 | 林恩、金花</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 | 金花</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案 | 林恩</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/BGM List</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Breathe Easy – Snoozy Beats</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jazz Dreams – Snoozy Beats</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fly Me To The Moon –Frank Sinatra/Count Basie and His Orchestra</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Contact</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：胡话酒馆播客</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bd1547d8426f692c8dc88/lots-llUITE6tibRIv3iaKvQcUif.m4a" length="89003284" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:31:43</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjB33gNIlIsxp43FeiLLyokltmX6.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
