  <item>
    <title>03.春节闯关指南：在人生KPI中佛系刷分</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679c61d9d74435e4a37d19e9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679c61d9d74435e4a37d19e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 05:57:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFfVEOuXcgdL49S9KhxsFybqp_3.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>春节期间在幼儿园当孩子王的猫主播Yukon</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>/Summary</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这一期，在春节的鞭炮声与烟火气里，聊起了当代青年“既传统又叛逆”的春节。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些记忆里的年味——擦防盗网的童年、踩着春晚开饭的忙碌、长辈离世后年夜饭的悄然变迁，像蒙尘的水晶球被轻轻擦亮。我们笑着自嘲“在上班和上进之间选择上香”，却也认真讨论：当传统仪式被简化，当“人生主旋律问题”像春晚小品般循环播放，我们如何守住自己的边界，又如何在代际差异中传递爱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客没有标准答案，只有两位女性在春节的喧闹与孤独里，笨拙而真诚的探索。或许，年夜饭的菜会凉，红包的金额会变，但那些藏在“黑暗料理”里的孝心、在寺庙许愿时的停顿、甚至和亲戚“斗智斗勇”的掀桌战局，都是我们与家人笨拙相爱的证据。</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿所有远行的人，都能在奔赴山海时，依然握紧那根名叫“牵挂”的线。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Show Note</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【春节逃跑计划】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 酒馆蛇年祝福：从“发大达”到“成为更好的自己”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 春节计划怎么过：躲大理看云 VS 财神庙敲木鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>【春节仪式大赏】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 春节的旧仪式与新操作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 当代年轻人的拜佛新姿势，记得要念身份证号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 年夜饭的代际变迁：长辈去世后的刺痛与和解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 广东人硬核过年实录：擦防盗网+拜神熏到流泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a> 广东红包法则：工作前爸妈给红包，工作后反向发红包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a> 穷鬼揽红包攻略：收红包时卖惨，送孝心时摆烂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 孝心攀比？ 你应对你的，我解决我的</span></p><span></span><p><span>【春节拷问盘点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 盘点过年在饭桌上必定受到的拷问：催婚&amp;收入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 霸道林恩强势掀桌大战实例，硬刀子软刀子都会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a> 金花的十级太极推手教学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 如何应对收入拷问</span></p><span></span><p><span>【闯关攻略】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2731">45:31</a> 过有选择人生，是否要回家过年也一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2779">46:19</a> 把春节当成项目来做，结果导向，抓大放小</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2883">48:03</a> 洞察拷问背后的动机，对问题进行分类处理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a> 为什么明明爱你却要拷问你，本质是要改变小家庭对成功的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 把自己当成一个演员，演一部春节大戏&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Staff</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播 | 林恩、金花</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作 | 金花</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案 | 林恩</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/BGM List</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Breathe Easy – Snoozy Beats</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jazz Dreams – Snoozy Beats</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fly Me To The Moon –Frank Sinatra/Count Basie and His Orchestra</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/Contact</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：胡话酒馆播客</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/675bd1547d8426f692c8dc88/lr47QAPM0RHCGDNM2q_4RONknip1.m4a" length="53478489" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:06</itunes:duration>
