  <item>
    <title>01.职场逃生记：一场双人离职的深夜对话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/675c2fe384447b1bd0abbf6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">675c2fe384447b1bd0abbf6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Dec 2024 14:22:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj_5rCNZEzO4Ff4OPkvOIe-cew5t.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>胡话酒馆 猫主播 Yukon</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>首期镇楼</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>/Summary</span></p><span></span><h2><span>这一期，我们聊聊裁员“大礼包”和逃离“毒气职场”的心路历程，进行一个"告别复盘"。从薪资账本到内心抉择，从逃离内耗到回望复盘，我们在裁员潮中做了怎样的取舍，发生了什么样的故事，如何探索找到让自己快乐的选择，希望能在这段对话中让你感受到些许力量和启发！</span></h2><span></span><p><span>/Show Note</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">02:39</a> </span><em><span>第一期胡话酒馆正片开始</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a></span><em><span> 领到裁员大礼包的幸运儿</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a> 受不了职场毒气自离的小白鼠</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="405">06:45</a> 裁员潮中离职的必要条件是盘钱</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="824">13:44</a></span></em><span> </span><em><span>你是什么样的人决定了你要做什么选择</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 时刻和自己的身体和心情对话</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 不轻易提离职</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> 做让自己快乐的选择</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 状态回春九大问</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2788">46:28</a> 真的有认真在对上一份工作做复盘！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2862">47:42</a></span></em><span> </span><em><span>职场成熟度不高，真的会栽跟头</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 20%的本职工作+80%的人际管理</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3496">58:16</a> 建立多元化的人际关系，尝试突破天花板</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4131">1:08:51</a> 畅想一下未来吧</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4541">1:15:41</a> 看到自己的天赋点，去做自己</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>/BGM</span></em></p><span></span><h2><em><span>Breathe Easy – Snoozy Beats</span></em></h2><span></span><h2><em><span>Jazz Dreams – Snoozy Beats</span></em></h2><span></span><p><em><span>Fly Me To The Moon –Frank Sinatra/Count Basie and His Orchestra</span></em></p>]]></description>
